{"action": "amend", "added": [], "amendment": 2, "escalations": [], "frozen_at": "2026-09-04T00:23:30", "goals_canon": "f3e73e360652df75e86a404267563ff8786e47d3a3528bb6ce1fbe5572aebb28", "head": "bda6e4dc7407511a2b82b6612ff403a62fef9a05", "modified": [{"new": "91d6ab9c38a18a29b8324be97c5a5e068747644cc0bd1475fc22981e16f67cc0", "old": "57a061df046ec2b0226296e45b959f70249eae135f9f3619e52d469d7b570858", "path": ".swarm-loop/acceptance/test_t6_pipeline.py"}], "prev_frozen_at": "2026-09-03T23:19:36", "reason": "ESC-006, granted by the goal owner 2026-09-04. The frozen t6 module survived three sabotages, each measured with the sabotage confirmed present in the loaded source and caches cleared both sides. WORST: replacing 'facts = await apply_taste(...)' with 'facts = candidates' left it 11/11 GREEN \u2014 the product's scored differentiator could be absent entirely. Its two taste assertions ('at least one fact survives', 'kept + excluded == total') both hold identically when taste is never called, and the corpus contained no sentence the rules exclude. Also survived: flat connector-order truncation instead of round-robin (github never reached the model at all), and deletion of the per-connector trim (masked because 4 documents over 3 sources is <=2 each regardless). THREE ADDITIONS, no existing assertion changed: a dedicated test scripting a deterministically-excluded fact (home_or_property, no LLM call) and asserting the pipeline excludes it with a reason; a spread assertion that all three connectors reach the model under the tight budget; and a case where max_docs_total is deliberately non-binding so the per-connector trim is the only cap. The excludable sentence is scripted through the double's overrides rather than added to the shared corpus, because the double SYNTHESISES fact text from a document's evidence span rather than reading its sentences \u2014 measured: appending the sentence to _raw_doc produced no excludable fact. That keeps the resolver's independence arithmetic and the budget arithmetic untouched. ALL THREE VERIFIED NON-VACUOUS by an independent agent re-running each sabotage cold; my first draft of the spread assertion was vacuous (>=2 kinds still passes under flat concatenation, which reaches exactly 2) and was tightened to full coverage before sealing.", "removed": [], "seq": 6, "targets_moved": []}
